<i>The gift of a friend</i>

948
01:13:29.205 --> 01:13:33.505
<i>Someone who knows
when your lost and you're scared</i>

949
01:13:33.910 --> 01:13:37.846
<i>There through
the highs and the lows</i>

950
01:13:38.582 --> 01:13:42.848
<i>Someone to count on
Someone who cares</i>

951
01:13:42.953 --> 01:13:46.855
<i>Beside you wherever you'll go</i>

952
01:13:47.457 --> 01:13:51.723
<i>You'll change inside</i>

953
01:13:52.228 --> 01:13:55.959
<i>When you realize</i>

954
