958
01:14:07.844 --> 01:14:10.677
<i>That helps you to find</i>

959
01:14:11.314 --> 01:14:15.478
<i>The beauty you are
when you open your heart</i>

960
01:14:15.585 --> 01:14:18.918
<i>And believe in</i>

961
01:14:19.689 --> 01:14:24.456
<i>The gift of a friend</i>

962
01:14:25.729 --> 01:14:30.359
<i>And when your hope crashes down
Shattering to the ground</i>

963
01:14:30.467 --> 01:14:33.732
<i>You'll feel all alone</i>

964
01:14:34.270 --> 01:14:37.364
<i>When you don't know which way to go</i>

965
01:14:37.474 --> 01:14:41.171
<i>And there's no signs leading you on</i>

966
01:14:43.413 --> 01:14:46.507
<i>You're not alone</i>

