<i>When you believe in</i>

977
01:15:20.684 --> 01:15:24.984
<i>The gift of a friend</i>

978
01:15:52.982 --> 01:15:58.318
<i>Where the sunbeams play
in the highland glade</i>

979
01:15:58.688 --> 01:16:02.920
<i>Where the leaves are gently falling</i>

980
01:16:03.827 --> 01:16:09.766
<i>Where we used to dance
in the autumn shade</i>

981
01:16:10.300 --> 01:16:15.328
<i>My foolish pride drove you away</i>

982
01:16:15.572 --> 01:16:21.511
